{"title":"附录 A：Python / Async 速查（Appendix A: Python & Async Refresher）","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"附录 A：Python / Async 速查（Appendix A: Python & Async Refresher）"},"headingText":"附录 A：Python / Async 速查","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n\n本书约定（engineering-standard.md）：Python 3.12 + uv 管理 + ruff + mypy + pytest。本附录只列本书用到的最小集。\n\n## asyncio 速查\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\n\nasync def call(x):            # 协程：await 才执行\n    await asyncio.sleep(1)\n    return x\n\n# 并发执行 + 异常隔离（Ch9 铁律）\nresults = await asyncio.gather(*(call(i) for i in range(10)), return_exceptions=True)\n\n# 并发度控制（信号量）\nsem = asyncio.Semaphore(5)\nasync def guarded(x):\n    async with sem:\n        return await call(x)\n\n# 超时与取消\ntry:\n    out = await asyncio.wait_for(call(1), timeout=10)\nexcept asyncio.TimeoutError: ...\nt = asyncio.create_task(call(1)); t.cancel()   # 抛 CancelledError\n```\n\n纪律：**异步链上禁混同步阻塞调用**（同步 requests/DB 驱动会卡死事件循环）——LLM 调用、HTTP（httpx.AsyncClient）、DB（asyncpg）全异步。同步生态需求 → `asyncio.to_thread` 包裹。\n\n## 类型注解与 pytest 速查\n\n```python\ndef fn(x: int, *, flag: bool = False) -> str: ...   # 公共函数必注解（kw-only 推荐）\nclass Client(Protocol):                              # 结构化协议（第 11 章模式）\n    def complete(self, messages) -> Completion: ...\n\n# 测试分层（engineering-standard §4）\n# unit：FakeClient 回放（ch19 ScriptedClient 模式，确定性零成本）\n# integration：本地 Ollama；live：RUN_LIVE_TESTS=1 显式开启\n```\n\n详见第 9 章（并发语义）、第 7/19 章（mock 测试模式）。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n# 附录 A：Python / Async 速查\n\n本书约定（engineering-standard.md）：Python 3.12 + uv 管理 + ruff + mypy + pytest。本附录只列本书用到的最小集。\n\n## asyncio 速查\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\n\nasync def call(x):            # 协程：await 才执行\n    await asyncio.sleep(1)\n    return x\n\n# 并发执行 + 异常隔离（Ch9 铁律）\nresults = await asyncio.gather(*(call(i) for i in range(10)), return_exceptions=True)\n\n# 并发度控制（信号量）\nsem = asyncio.Semaphore(5)\nasync def guarded(x):\n    async with sem:\n        return await call(x)\n\n# 超时与取消\ntry:\n    out = await asyncio.wait_for(call(1), timeout=10)\nexcept asyncio.TimeoutError: ...\nt = asyncio.create_task(call(1)); t.cancel()   # 抛 CancelledError\n```\n\n纪律：**异步链上禁混同步阻塞调用**（同步 requests/DB 驱动会卡死事件循环）——LLM 调用、HTTP（httpx.AsyncClient）、DB（asyncpg）全异步。同步生态需求 → `asyncio.to_thread` 包裹。\n\n## 类型注解与 pytest 速查\n\n```python\ndef fn(x: int, *, flag: bool = False) -> str: ...   # 公共函数必注解（kw-only 推荐）\nclass Client(Protocol):                              # 结构化协议（第 11 章模式）\n    def complete(self, messages) -> Completion: ...\n\n# 测试分层（engineering-standard §4）\n# unit：FakeClient 回放（ch19 ScriptedClient 模式，确定性零成本）\n# integration：本地 Ollama；live：RUN_LIVE_TESTS=1 显式开启\n```\n\n详见第 9 章（并发语义）、第 7/19 章（mock 测试模式）。\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"wrap","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"p